name: tb_box_members
description: "Suspected SIM-box members: each candidate SIM linked to the box it belongs to (the cluster key reads imei:, cell: or batch:, then the value; the link kind is the key that decided it). Open it from a tb_box_suspected Incident to see every SIM of one box as a Working Set, then Explain node or Centrality on the device or the cell. Synthetic until fed from an operator's CDRs."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force-cluster
profile: telecom
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: tb_cluster_members
    sourceCol: msisdn
    targetCol: cluster_key
    linkKindCol: cluster_kind
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
